        "critical_failure": "As failure, but 4d6+14 poison damageand enfeebled 2.",
        "critical_success": "The creature is unaffected.",
        "effect": "A dozen eyes blink open on the spherical shape to glare at the triggering creature, who must succeed at a DC 22 Will save or become frightened 1 (frightened 2 on a critical failure). The trap then rolls initiative.",
        "failure": "The creature takes 2d6+7 poison damage and becomes enfeebled 1 as their flesh and muscles grow limp and saggy.",
